<section id="ddb-importer-muncher-intro" class="tab ddb-muncher {{ tab.cssClass }} {{#if tab.active}} active{{/if}}" data-group="{{tab.group}}" data-tab="{{tab.id}}">
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Introduction</legend>
    <p>Integrate and munch your D&D Beyond content directly into Foundry VTT via the Jenne Suite.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>All endpoints are powered by your self-hosted Jenne DDB Proxy.</li>
      <li>Munch operations can take several minutes for large compendiums; keep the browser tab open while munching.</li>
      <li>Compendiums are organized and structured for full compatibility with D&D 5e and Jenne Bag of Holding.</li>
    </ul>
  </fieldset>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>General Workflow</legend>
    <p>Recommended order: Spells, Items, Monsters, Vehicles, and then Adventures.</p>
  </fieldset>
  <fieldset>
    <button data-action="openCoreSetup" type="button" id="munch-open-core-setup" class="munch-button">Open Core Setup</button>
  </fieldset>
</section>
